      "2": "Complete raw retains shaped human upper lip and distinct glossy peach raised lower lip under moustache. Replace both with one simple grey mascot mouth while preserving source expression. Keep brown receding waved side-parted hair, separate brows, moustache and small pointed chin patch, black broad-lapel suit/white pointed shirt/dark grey patterned tie, screen-right three-quarter gaze/crop/light/full pale-grey backing. Broad collar connected without narrow stalk or cream bib. Tiny tie pattern and hair fibres unresolved. Whole raw/mattes solid opaque.",
      "4": "Complete raw has a long exposed yellow column from mouth/chin to low white collar, and a separate glossy peach lower lip with shaped upper-lip anatomy. Shorten lower-head-to-collar transition to compact broad mascot proportions and use one simple grey wedge mouth. Preserve red flat-crown kepi/navy band/two gold leaf rows/black visor, short dark temple hair/separate brows/clean chin, tan uniform/gold shoulder buttons/white pointed shirt/dark tie, near-frontal serious gaze/crop/light/full pale-grey backing. No cream bib or missing backing. Tiny embroidery and cloth fibres unresolved. Whole raw/mattes solid opaque."
